---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden px-6 py-24 md:py-28">
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[linear-gradient(155deg,#3FA66B_0%,#8BC34A_100%)]"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    class="absolute -bottom-28 -left-24 -z-10 h-[360px] w-[360px] rounded-full bg-white opacity-10"
  >
  </div>

  <div
    class="relative z-10 mx-auto flex max-w-[600px] flex-col items-center gap-5 text-center"
  >
    <h2 class="text-2xl text-[#F6FBF3] md:text-[32px]">PR・タイアップのご相談</h2>
    <p class="text-[16.5px] leading-loose text-[#E7F5DE]">
      PR案件のご依頼は、Instagram
      DMからお気軽にどうぞ。内容を拝見のうえ、丁寧にご返信いたします。
    </p>
    <a
      href="https://www.instagram.com/cochi_kurashi_note/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full bg-white px-8 py-4.5 text-base font-bold text-[#2E8B57] shadow-[0_14px_30px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)]"
    >
      <svg
        width="20"
        height="20"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        ><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"></rect><circle
          cx="12"
          cy="12"
          r="4"></circle><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1"></circle></svg
      >
      Instagram DMでご相談する
    </a>
    <span class="text-sm text-[#E7F5DE] opacity-90">@cochi_kurashi_note</span>
  </div>
</section>
